# title: Call spread (capped call)
# category: Vanillas and digitals
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A call whose gain is capped at 20% of the initial level: long an at-the-money call, short a 120% call.
#
# Strike 100%, cap 120% of the strike-date level.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()

2028-01-04
    pays min(max(spot() - s0, 0), 0.20 * s0)
